WEBVTT

01:33.150 --> 01:35.904
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:36.004 --> 01:37.806
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:37.906 --> 01:40.978
(Episode 10)

01:44.666 --> 01:45.746
I heard from your mom

01:45.834 --> 01:47.855
that she has been arranging blind dates for you lately.

01:47.936 --> 01:48.936
How's it going?

01:49.017 --> 01:50.017
Any progress?

01:52.240 --> 01:53.240
Dad,

01:53.668 --> 01:55.628
can't I find someone I like?

01:58.548 --> 01:59.548
So,

02:00.109 --> 02:02.029
you're saying you already have someone you like?

02:05.187 --> 02:06.306
I don't want to live a life

02:06.734 --> 02:07.975
that's arranged for me.

02:08.807 --> 02:11.308
I don't want a life where I know exactly how it will end.

02:14.921 --> 02:16.401
All parents are like this.

02:17.122 --> 02:19.328
We don't want our children to go down the wrong path.

02:20.042 --> 02:21.042
Our generation has gone

02:21.521 --> 02:22.521
through hardships,

02:23.241 --> 02:25.241
so we've developed some bad habits.

02:26.641 --> 02:28.641
We tend to calculate gains and losses

02:28.961 --> 02:29.961
in everything we do.

02:30.212 --> 02:32.347
That's why we believe matching family backgrounds is important.

02:32.442 --> 02:34.521
We believe that love and marriage

02:36.002 --> 02:37.454
should be based on equal conditions

02:37.562 --> 02:38.921
and economic compatibility.

02:39.002 --> 02:40.568
Your mother wants the best for you,

02:41.201 --> 02:42.201
and she's not wrong.

02:42.722 --> 02:44.681
I'm not going against Mom on purpose.

02:45.394 --> 02:46.994
I just want to have freedom

02:47.214 --> 02:48.214
in deciding my life.

02:50.961 --> 02:51.961
Qin Qin,

02:52.401 --> 02:53.882
will you

02:54.921 --> 02:56.080
be honest with me?

02:56.322 --> 02:57.401
Do you

02:58.122 --> 02:59.122
still like

02:59.722 --> 03:01.042
that boy surnamed Song?

03:04.562 --> 03:06.241
No wonder your mom is so angry.

03:07.882 --> 03:09.228
She will never approve of it.

03:12.921 --> 03:14.989
What about you?

03:15.281 --> 03:16.573
Do you also disapprove of us?

03:19.122 --> 03:20.122
To be honest,

03:20.961 --> 03:21.961
I'm a bit worried.

03:23.532 --> 03:25.292
You know your mom's temper.

03:26.442 --> 03:28.002
She will do whatever it takes

03:29.122 --> 03:30.721
to prevent you two from being together.

03:31.641 --> 03:32.641
Qin Qin,

03:33.882 --> 03:36.162
I really don't want our family

03:37.882 --> 03:39.442
to fall apart because of this.

03:53.562 --> 03:55.961
I was just wondering why you applied to the local university.

03:56.042 --> 03:57.321
Turns out you stayed here

03:57.401 --> 04:00.301
for that little thug because he failed to get into college.

04:00.614 --> 04:02.294
You want to stay and date him in secret.

04:03.839 --> 04:05.679
You have disappointed me.

04:05.941 --> 04:07.201
You are deceiving your parents

04:07.681 --> 04:08.681
for that punk,

04:08.801 --> 04:10.282
that thug.

04:10.481 --> 04:12.442
You are giving up your future for him.

04:13.162 --> 04:15.442
Mom, he's not like what you said.

04:15.681 --> 04:17.121
Someone who skipped classes, got into fights,

04:17.201 --> 04:18.562
and can't even get into college,

04:18.802 --> 04:19.802
what can he amount to?

04:21.401 --> 04:22.401
Qin Qin,

04:22.922 --> 04:23.974
listen here,

04:24.161 --> 04:25.242
I will never allow

04:25.682 --> 04:26.922
you two to be together.

04:27.641 --> 04:28.761
If you don't listen to me,

04:28.841 --> 04:30.961
if you think he is more important than your family,

04:33.281 --> 04:34.882
then make a choice.

04:35.762 --> 04:37.201
Either choose this family

04:38.041 --> 04:39.721
or choose that little thug.

04:40.521 --> 04:41.521
Mom...

04:49.084 --> 04:51.416
When you eat, there are dining etiquette rules to follow.

04:52.041 --> 04:53.041
First,

04:53.641 --> 04:54.882
sit up straight.

04:55.442 --> 04:56.482
Hold the bowl properly.

04:57.482 --> 04:59.562
Eat spoon by spoon without making any noise.

05:00.762 --> 05:01.762
After finishing the soup,

05:02.281 --> 05:03.401
place the rice here.

05:04.401 --> 05:05.401
When taking a dish,

05:05.961 --> 05:08.762
your chopsticks shouldn't go back and forth more than three times.

05:08.870 --> 05:10.361
Only take the dish in front of you.

05:10.442 --> 05:11.961
Don't stir the dish with chopsticks.

05:12.041 --> 05:13.041
Got it?

05:13.875 --> 05:14.875
Yes.

05:15.567 --> 05:17.007
What did I tell you?

05:18.601 --> 05:21.041
Girls should be demure

05:21.922 --> 05:22.922
and poised.

05:23.948 --> 05:25.508
Always listen to your parents.

05:28.256 --> 05:29.256
Be well-behaved.

05:33.682 --> 05:34.682
Understand?

06:27.521 --> 06:28.521
It's so windy out here.

06:28.641 --> 06:29.807
Why didn't you wait inside?

06:30.442 --> 06:32.242
It's okay. I just got here too.

06:33.041 --> 06:34.041
Let's go.

07:10.041 --> 07:11.682
When you take leave,

07:12.841 --> 07:13.922
you usually have to return

07:14.129 --> 07:15.582
to the team within two hours, right?

07:17.199 --> 07:18.199
That's about right.

07:27.442 --> 07:29.241
Every time I tried to asked you out before,

07:31.281 --> 07:32.901
you would make excuses to turn me down.

07:36.084 --> 07:37.923
But this time, you agreed quickly.

07:42.991 --> 07:43.991
Xu Qin,

07:46.121 --> 07:47.282
just cut to the chase.

07:58.874 --> 07:59.874
You...

08:03.045 --> 08:04.165
You saved me

08:06.762 --> 08:07.841
a few times before.

08:12.442 --> 08:13.442
After this,

08:17.647 --> 08:19.128
let's call it square.

08:28.303 --> 08:29.303
Call it square?

08:47.002 --> 08:48.002
All right.

08:50.281 --> 08:51.460
We will call it square then.

08:55.497 --> 08:56.657
Enough talking.

08:57.441 --> 08:59.122
-Let's dig in. -Xu Qin.

09:03.521 --> 09:04.521
You want to say

09:06.401 --> 09:07.401
you were considering

09:08.082 --> 09:09.768
reconciling with me these past few days,

09:10.762 --> 09:12.795
but now you're afraid and changing your mind.

09:14.921 --> 09:16.962
Is it so difficult to confess just that?

09:20.561 --> 09:21.962
-I... -No need to say it anymore.

09:23.202 --> 09:24.202
I understand.

09:28.921 --> 09:30.293
Whatever you say, I'll accept it.

09:34.082 --> 09:35.082
We are done.

09:44.362 --> 09:45.362
All right.

09:54.082 --> 09:56.835
It's all because I took a glance at you in the hallway back then,

10:00.654 --> 10:01.853
I brought this upon myself.

10:04.900 --> 10:05.900
What?

11:03.321 --> 11:04.573
Is there a fire?

11:04.762 --> 11:06.202
There's a fire!

11:06.795 --> 11:08.315
Fire! Hurry!

11:10.202 --> 11:11.202
Fire!

11:11.232 --> 11:12.360
People are already evacuating.

11:12.441 --> 11:14.482
-Fire! -Stand back.

11:14.842 --> 11:15.842
Stand back! Stand back!

11:16.004 --> 11:17.164
Stand back, everyone!

11:17.441 --> 11:18.441
Careful. Stand back.

11:18.561 --> 11:20.462
I'm a firefighter. Are there still people inside?

11:20.561 --> 11:22.162
-Are there still people inside? -Our head chef is still inside.

11:22.242 --> 11:23.242
Please save him.

11:25.401 --> 11:26.401
Everyone, move back.

11:27.681 --> 11:29.321
Move back, move back.

11:35.990 --> 11:37.092
Get down first!

11:39.242 --> 11:40.242
Get down!

11:51.401 --> 11:52.401
Come on!

11:54.002 --> 11:55.441
Help! Is there anyone...

11:56.762 --> 11:59.561
-Go out. -Someone, help!

12:03.482 --> 12:04.162
-There is another one. -He's out.

12:04.242 --> 12:05.242
Chef!

12:06.882 --> 12:08.161
Take him to the hospital now!

12:09.514 --> 12:11.035
Take him to the hospital now! Hurry!

12:11.226 --> 12:12.466
Help!

12:13.242 --> 12:14.242
Help!

12:15.964 --> 12:17.284
Come with me!

12:18.002 --> 12:19.002
Come with me!

12:22.521 --> 12:23.521
Come!

12:29.002 --> 12:30.461
The fire brigade is on its way.

12:30.801 --> 12:33.002
Please make way for the firefighting access.

12:34.116 --> 12:35.116
Is there anyone inside?

12:35.717 --> 12:37.030
Is there still someone inside?

12:54.161 --> 12:55.161
Turn on the water!

13:01.109 --> 13:02.109
Turn the valve!

13:28.722 --> 13:30.402
Xu Qin, do you know him well or not?

13:30.539 --> 13:31.659
Please tell me.

13:32.882 --> 13:34.428
Please, Xu Qin.

13:34.509 --> 13:35.509
Please tell me.

13:36.842 --> 13:38.389
I don't actually know him that well.

13:45.681 --> 13:47.002
It's okay. I can approach him myself.

13:47.082 --> 13:48.813
Give me his number. WeChat ID is fine too.

13:51.202 --> 13:52.341
What are you trying to do?

13:52.482 --> 13:53.922
He's such a hot firefighter.

13:54.002 --> 13:55.715
And he saved my life. I have to court him, of course.

13:55.796 --> 13:57.641
Give me his number now. Please.

13:58.122 --> 13:59.122
Pretty please.

14:10.681 --> 14:11.980
The last number in my contacts.

14:13.041 --> 14:14.361
You're the best. When he becomes my boyfriend,

14:14.448 --> 14:15.650
I'll treat you to a really nice meal.

14:15.722 --> 14:17.441
-Which one is it? -This one.

14:17.921 --> 14:19.602
The last number in your contacts.

14:20.722 --> 14:22.161
Hold on. Let me call him now.

14:34.122 --> 14:36.042
-(Hello.) -Hello. Hi.

14:36.122 --> 14:38.041
I'm the girl with long hair

14:38.321 --> 14:40.882
and wearing a black dress whom you just saved, remember me?

14:42.122 --> 14:43.122
(No.)

14:44.242 --> 14:45.802
It's okay. Next time we meet,

14:45.882 --> 14:47.002
you'll remember me.

14:47.321 --> 14:49.762
You saved my life. I'd like to treat you to a meal.

14:52.321 --> 14:53.321
(No need.)

14:53.681 --> 14:55.053
How about we grab a drink then?

15:00.921 --> 15:02.602
This guy is pretty interesting.

15:03.122 --> 15:05.041
-Are you still going to pursue him? -Of course.

15:05.921 --> 15:08.122
My gut feeling tells me that he must be a good man.

15:08.348 --> 15:11.842
I was just young and foolish to be attracted to Xiao Yi Xiao that scumbag.

15:12.175 --> 15:14.481
Just wait and see. He will be my boyfriend.

15:14.681 --> 15:15.681
Drive.

15:25.401 --> 15:26.401
Get ready.

15:28.457 --> 15:29.577
Spread out the water bags.

15:30.041 --> 15:31.607
Pay attention to the connection point.

15:32.602 --> 15:33.602
Don't make any mistakes.

15:34.801 --> 15:35.801
Jiang.

15:36.202 --> 15:37.202
Captain.

15:38.882 --> 15:39.882
Where is Yang Chi?

15:40.521 --> 15:41.521
Yang Chi is in...

15:44.122 --> 15:45.122
He's in the gym room.

15:47.202 --> 15:49.281
-All right. Carry on. -Yes, sir.

15:53.002 --> 15:54.242
Come on, let's do it again.

16:27.516 --> 16:28.516
Couldn't sleep?

17:04.561 --> 17:05.561
I mean, this guy,

17:09.760 --> 17:10.760
his son was

17:12.026 --> 17:14.393
abducted by human traffickers when he was four years old.

17:17.002 --> 17:18.562
His wife got sick two months ago

17:18.801 --> 17:19.801
and passed away.

17:21.948 --> 17:23.267
This couple

17:23.705 --> 17:25.626
works tirelessly to save up.

17:26.241 --> 17:28.347
They managed to save up some money by selling buns,

17:29.321 --> 17:31.487
but then they got caught up in an online lending scam.

17:31.646 --> 17:33.333
They lost everything they had invested.

17:37.481 --> 17:38.481
Sometimes,

17:39.361 --> 17:40.801
maybe for him,

17:43.258 --> 17:44.899
death might seem easier than living.

17:49.998 --> 17:51.597
I mean, did I do...

17:55.470 --> 17:56.470
I...

18:05.780 --> 18:07.762
Everyone has a different definition of life.

18:08.550 --> 18:10.110
They make different choices.

18:11.881 --> 18:13.282
You fulfilled your duty.

18:14.790 --> 18:15.790
So,

18:16.515 --> 18:17.594
don't feel guilty.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.960
Some people

18:27.201 --> 18:28.762
just got trapped in that moment.

18:29.720 --> 18:30.720
And what we need to do

18:32.121 --> 18:33.740
is to provide those trapped individuals

18:34.148 --> 18:35.148
with another choice.

18:36.121 --> 18:37.121
The choice to live.

18:40.682 --> 18:41.721
After all, some people,

18:42.007 --> 18:43.487
once they get past that predicament,

18:43.994 --> 18:45.195
will choose to live.

18:47.522 --> 18:48.522
Right?

18:59.361 --> 19:00.762
I really envy you.

19:01.420 --> 19:02.940
You never seem lost.

19:06.801 --> 19:07.801
I've experienced it too.

19:09.081 --> 19:10.242
No one is made of steel.

19:12.041 --> 19:13.041
How can one not feel lost

19:14.121 --> 19:15.121
or confused?

19:23.002 --> 19:24.002
Song Yan,

19:24.881 --> 19:25.962
let's get back together.

19:28.642 --> 19:29.642
After this,

19:30.601 --> 19:32.002
let's call it square.

20:29.558 --> 20:30.997
What's up, Qin Qin?

20:31.202 --> 20:32.408
Your brother isn't around,

20:33.495 --> 20:35.188
so, you want to talk about life with me?

20:36.442 --> 20:38.775
Come here then. Tonight, I'll be your companion.

20:40.041 --> 20:41.722
-All right. -Ye Zi.

20:42.162 --> 20:43.162
Ye Zi.

20:44.002 --> 20:45.475
Take these two bottles over there.

20:47.962 --> 20:49.041
Reserve this room for me.

20:49.242 --> 20:51.201
I got a friend coming later. Just bring her here.

20:54.762 --> 20:55.762
What are you doing here?

21:01.002 --> 21:02.002
Ms. Zhan,

21:02.881 --> 21:04.761
it's a bit inappropriate for you to occupy

21:04.841 --> 21:05.841
such a big room alone.

21:07.494 --> 21:08.697
Let me get you another room.

21:08.762 --> 21:11.265
I'll also arrange a few companions for you to heat things up.

21:12.321 --> 21:13.321
Get lost.

21:13.360 --> 21:15.400
You can't get me the hot guy I want.

21:15.904 --> 21:17.105
Are you underestimating me?

21:17.642 --> 21:20.275
Whatever type of hot guys you want, I can find them for you.

21:20.808 --> 21:23.161
Are you getting involved in some shady business now, Mr. Xiao?

21:23.242 --> 21:25.655
What's shady with introducing potential boyfriends for you?

21:29.442 --> 21:31.321
Why didn't you tell me you were coming?

21:35.402 --> 21:37.295
Why did you also come here without telling me?

21:38.402 --> 21:39.595
I didn't know you were here.

21:46.841 --> 21:47.841
Fine.

21:48.103 --> 21:49.664
And I can't even send you both away.

21:50.762 --> 21:52.061
Waitress, bring us some water.

21:57.202 --> 21:58.202
Where is Qin Qin?

21:58.580 --> 21:59.939
I saw her car downstairs.

22:00.962 --> 22:01.962
She isn't here.

22:02.762 --> 22:04.081
She probably hasn't arrived yet.

22:19.301 --> 22:20.420
What a day.

22:26.482 --> 22:27.482
Let me explain.

22:27.682 --> 22:28.763
This is a coincidence.

22:28.844 --> 22:30.483
I didn't invite them.

22:31.246 --> 22:32.246
You're here, Qin Qin.

22:33.841 --> 22:34.841
Have a seat.

22:41.962 --> 22:43.402
Xiao Rao, what are you doing?

22:44.202 --> 22:45.202
Asking someone out.

22:45.626 --> 22:47.362
She has been texting someone this whole time.

22:47.442 --> 22:48.781
Who are you texting?

22:49.163 --> 22:50.799
You are so attached to each other.

22:50.962 --> 22:52.051
It's one-sided.

22:52.132 --> 22:54.281
I invited him for supper, but he rejected me.

22:54.514 --> 22:56.682
I sent him so many messages. He doesn't reply at all.

22:57.041 --> 22:58.361
This guy is so heartless.

22:58.922 --> 23:01.082
Do you know how difficult it was to find out when he has time off?

23:01.162 --> 23:03.068
If I miss this chance, I'll have to wait again.

23:04.242 --> 23:05.242
What kind of guy is he?

23:05.962 --> 23:07.482
Making you chase after him like this.

23:07.762 --> 23:08.762
I'm happy to.

23:08.916 --> 23:10.200
What's wrong with pursuing someone you like?

23:10.281 --> 23:12.562
You guys do the same, why can't we women? Right?

23:12.642 --> 23:14.682
All right, all right. No one says you can't.

23:17.762 --> 23:19.722
He agreed to see me!

23:21.029 --> 23:22.070
You're being dramatic.

23:24.162 --> 23:25.162
What are you doing now?

23:25.532 --> 23:27.803
I have a date. No time to hang out with you guys anymore.

23:27.868 --> 23:30.072
Who is this guy? You're so invested in him.

23:30.147 --> 23:31.268
He's a firefighter.

23:31.521 --> 23:32.521
He saved my life.

23:33.173 --> 23:35.682
And he's got a really nice name,

23:35.920 --> 23:36.920
Song Yan.

23:38.521 --> 23:39.521
Bye.

23:48.442 --> 23:49.561
I'm going to wash my hands.

24:34.242 --> 24:35.242
Are you okay?

25:10.521 --> 25:12.041
What on earth is that smell?

25:12.321 --> 25:13.659
-Come here. -What are you doing? It's stinky.

25:13.740 --> 25:17.281
Come. The Internet said to marinate it for a week.

25:17.361 --> 25:19.281
It's not a week yet. How did it become so smelly?

25:22.722 --> 25:25.122
Did you put too little salt?

25:25.202 --> 25:27.121
Put the lid back first. Close it.

25:27.402 --> 25:29.442
Maybe it's already stinky before I marinated it.

25:29.925 --> 25:31.284
That's nonsense.

25:31.762 --> 25:34.148
This mandarin fish is quite expensive. You just wasted it.

25:35.121 --> 25:36.562
I definitely won't eat it.

25:36.642 --> 25:37.642
It's too smelly.

25:37.831 --> 25:40.161
Too smelly? Who said durian was so stinky

25:40.242 --> 25:41.841
she'd never eat it?

25:42.121 --> 25:45.200
Who later became addicted to it and enjoyed it more the stronger it smelled?

25:45.321 --> 25:47.562
You are so annoying!

25:47.642 --> 25:48.962
All right now. Cut it out.

25:49.402 --> 25:51.121
So, what is Yan doing?

25:52.242 --> 25:53.242
He's upstairs.

25:53.561 --> 25:55.361
He went to see Qin Qin yesterday, didn't he?

25:57.482 --> 25:58.482
Why did he have to...

25:59.402 --> 26:00.402
He can't keep doing this.

26:00.482 --> 26:01.715
We must be stricter with him.

26:03.402 --> 26:04.402
What does that mean?

26:04.459 --> 26:06.058
We should reprimand him.

26:06.360 --> 26:07.562
We need to set strict rules for him.

26:07.654 --> 26:09.453
He is not allowed to see Qin Qin anymore.

26:09.630 --> 26:11.441
Every time he sees her, he gets hurt.

26:11.521 --> 26:12.834
What's the point of seeing her?

26:14.801 --> 26:16.745
-You're right. -Let's talk to him now.

26:16.905 --> 26:18.664
-I will come with you. -Okay.

26:25.561 --> 26:27.402
Yan, you're going out?

26:28.642 --> 26:31.402
-You want to talk to me? -Your uncle wants to talk to you.

26:31.922 --> 26:33.122
-Go on. -Hang on.

26:33.202 --> 26:34.202
What's the matter?

26:38.402 --> 26:39.402
What stinks so bad?

26:39.426 --> 26:40.862
Yes, I was just about to tell you this.

26:40.928 --> 26:43.017
It's this stinky mandarin fish, it really stinks.

26:43.098 --> 26:44.848
It's so stinky that it has a pungent odor.

26:47.242 --> 26:48.242
That's all?

26:49.404 --> 26:50.765
Where are you going?

26:51.121 --> 26:52.121
I'm going out for a walk.

26:52.306 --> 26:54.441
Yes, go and get some fresh air. The night is beautiful.

26:54.521 --> 26:55.521
The air is fresh too.

26:58.922 --> 26:59.922
Uncle,

27:00.782 --> 27:01.782
did you drink?

27:02.467 --> 27:03.467
A little bit.

27:07.081 --> 27:08.081
Come home early.

27:10.081 --> 27:10.961
Why didn't you tell him?

27:11.041 --> 27:12.441
I'm a guy. I shouldn't be the one bringing that up.

27:12.526 --> 27:14.496
Commander Miao, you should talk to him. I taught you.

27:14.561 --> 27:16.598
You taught me? We agreed that you would talk to him.

27:16.682 --> 27:18.362
-What's wrong with you? -I concealed it quite well, didn't I?

27:18.442 --> 27:19.801
-Let's go in. -You're useless.

27:19.881 --> 27:21.682
-Let's go in. -No, it's stinky in there.

27:21.762 --> 27:24.435
Let's get changed and go out for a stroll. Let the smell dissipate.

27:38.153 --> 27:39.153
One more.

27:44.601 --> 27:46.242
Give me Boss's Ardbeg Scorch.

27:59.081 --> 28:00.081
More.

28:46.202 --> 28:47.202
Boss, here's your wine.

28:48.877 --> 28:49.881
Okay.

28:51.081 --> 28:52.762
I got this from an auction.

28:53.121 --> 28:54.121
You should try it.

28:54.642 --> 28:55.642
Drink it yourself.

29:01.722 --> 29:02.922
Why isn't Qin Qin back yet?

29:04.561 --> 29:06.121
She didn't leave again, did she?

29:06.841 --> 29:07.841
Let's find out.

29:12.081 --> 29:14.041
-Ye Zi. -Yes, Boss?

29:15.148 --> 29:17.720
Can you go to the women's restroom and see if our friend is there?

29:17.801 --> 29:19.402
She was just at the bar drinking alone.

29:19.482 --> 29:20.482
She has already left.

29:21.601 --> 29:22.601
She just left.

29:32.482 --> 29:33.482
Qin Qin,

29:34.242 --> 29:35.242
let me take you home.

29:35.881 --> 29:37.202
No need. I can go by myself.

29:39.941 --> 29:41.421
Sir, Lanxuan Apartment, please.

29:41.510 --> 29:42.510
Drive slowly.

29:45.561 --> 29:46.561
Was Qin Qin drinking

29:47.081 --> 29:48.121
to drown her sorrows?

29:49.081 --> 29:50.081
No,

29:50.402 --> 29:51.575
it was to boost her courage.

29:53.361 --> 29:54.361
Come with me.

30:02.297 --> 30:03.896
Sir, Wufang Street, please.

30:04.041 --> 30:05.841
Didn't that mister say Lanxuan Apartment?

30:06.202 --> 30:07.962
I want to go to Wufang Street. Thank you.

30:08.242 --> 30:09.242
All right.

30:26.682 --> 30:28.242
This is not the direction to her house.

30:28.323 --> 30:29.882
You got it right.

31:30.919 --> 31:31.919
Song Yan!

31:34.628 --> 31:36.027
Song Yan!

31:39.661 --> 31:40.741
Song Yan!

31:41.194 --> 31:43.554
-Who is it? -Song Yan!

31:44.199 --> 31:45.278
Song Yan!

31:47.922 --> 31:48.922
It's you.

31:51.002 --> 31:52.035
What are you doing?

31:52.147 --> 31:53.547
Do you know how late it is now?

31:54.242 --> 31:55.242
Stop right there!

31:58.841 --> 32:00.682
Do you know how late it is now?

32:10.521 --> 32:11.521
Song Yan?

32:13.561 --> 32:14.922
Song Yan, are you in bed?

32:16.732 --> 32:17.732
Song Yan?

32:18.202 --> 32:19.202
It's me.

32:20.002 --> 32:21.002
Stop knocking.

32:21.242 --> 32:22.242
My brother isn't home.

32:26.281 --> 32:27.482
Where is he?

32:28.908 --> 32:30.178
He's on a date with someone.

32:30.255 --> 32:32.255
He isn't coming home tonight. You should go.

32:47.561 --> 32:49.601
I feel like dying.

32:50.682 --> 32:52.361
There is no point in living.

32:52.642 --> 32:54.121
What's wrong?

32:54.722 --> 32:55.722
Are you okay?

33:07.202 --> 33:08.202
Are you okay?

33:09.841 --> 33:11.642
Why don't you sit down for a while?

33:14.922 --> 33:17.348
These are my brother's shoes. He forgot to put them away.

33:18.242 --> 33:19.762
What are you doing?

33:22.202 --> 33:23.202
Have you lost your mind?

33:26.081 --> 33:27.081
You...

33:29.361 --> 33:30.361
You...

33:32.321 --> 33:33.682
Yan, look at her!

33:34.642 --> 33:36.035
She's drunk and acting crazy here.

33:59.668 --> 34:00.668
What are you doing here?

34:02.002 --> 34:03.002
Sorry about this.

34:03.071 --> 34:04.451
She drank too much. She's wasted.

34:04.762 --> 34:05.762
Let's go.

34:07.676 --> 34:08.676
Let's go home.

34:13.101 --> 34:14.101
Stop there.

34:16.082 --> 34:17.082
Where were you?

34:22.991 --> 34:24.031
I went out with a girl.

34:25.001 --> 34:26.001
You know her.

34:26.082 --> 34:27.082
What's her name again?

34:30.441 --> 34:31.441
Her surname is Zhan,

34:32.122 --> 34:33.522
her name is Xiao Rao.

34:37.706 --> 34:38.706
Xu Qin,

34:39.122 --> 34:40.122
what are you doing?

34:40.407 --> 34:42.273
What gives you the right to make a scene here?

34:46.481 --> 34:47.481
Let's go.

34:48.235 --> 34:50.048
There's nothing to say to someone like this.

34:50.635 --> 34:51.914
He doesn't deserve you.

34:53.455 --> 34:55.321
Let's go home. Come on.

34:55.401 --> 34:56.401
You are right.

34:57.325 --> 34:59.446
You don't deserve me. You do not deserve me.

35:11.406 --> 35:12.726
Because I like you

35:13.361 --> 35:14.722
more than you like me.

35:24.252 --> 35:25.531
I'm not good at socializing

35:26.242 --> 35:27.682
and I don't like making friends.

35:30.281 --> 35:31.281
Professions like finance,

35:31.841 --> 35:32.841
law,

35:33.834 --> 35:34.834
and management

35:35.499 --> 35:37.100
aren't suitable for me.

35:40.335 --> 35:41.808
Only being a doctor works for me.

35:44.527 --> 35:46.093
I just need to master the profession.

35:48.762 --> 35:50.573
And I won't have to worry about unemployment.

35:51.281 --> 35:52.441
I can support myself.

35:54.562 --> 35:55.562
When I returned to China,

35:57.119 --> 35:58.760
I moved out from my parents' house.

35:59.562 --> 36:01.001
I am planning

36:01.560 --> 36:02.681
to gradually

36:03.959 --> 36:05.839
stop relying on the money

36:06.428 --> 36:08.028
and things my parents provide.

36:10.332 --> 36:11.571
I'm thinking about

36:13.468 --> 36:14.468
what I can do

36:16.228 --> 36:18.507
to make my parents not angry,

36:20.682 --> 36:21.682
not opposed us,

36:23.021 --> 36:25.202
and not disown me as their daughter.

36:32.762 --> 36:34.202
Maybe if I study my profession well

36:34.602 --> 36:35.961
and quickly become a top-notch

36:36.841 --> 36:38.361
and renowned surgeon,

36:41.881 --> 36:44.321
they will accept me from other aspects.

36:45.221 --> 36:46.880
If I can make them feel a little proud,

36:48.570 --> 36:50.371
maybe they will indulge me a little more.

36:54.602 --> 36:55.682
But what about you?

36:56.678 --> 36:58.439
What have you done, Song Yan?

36:59.560 --> 37:01.201
What have you done for me?

37:07.923 --> 37:08.923
Let me ask you,

37:10.307 --> 37:12.668
have you made any effort for me?

37:14.682 --> 37:15.682
Yes.

37:17.162 --> 37:18.661
I keep trying to get closer to you.

37:20.001 --> 37:21.800
I keep hesitating.

37:22.168 --> 37:23.805
I go back and forth.

37:24.106 --> 37:25.666
I'm hesitant and weak.

37:27.562 --> 37:31.042
I can't see any hope, and I'm afraid.

37:32.042 --> 37:33.562
You have never made

37:33.921 --> 37:35.562
even the slightest effort

37:36.682 --> 37:38.642
to make things work for us.

37:40.481 --> 37:41.841
Never.

37:59.642 --> 38:00.642
Am I right?

38:03.412 --> 38:04.613
I am right, am I?

38:05.602 --> 38:06.602
Song Yan,

38:07.562 --> 38:08.801
am I right?

38:13.001 --> 38:15.001
You don't like me that much, do you?

38:17.441 --> 38:19.481
Do you not like me enough?

38:22.321 --> 38:25.082
Why else wouldn't you have made any effort at all?

38:25.767 --> 38:27.886
You haven't even tried to get closer to me.

38:29.471 --> 38:30.912
Someone like you,

38:31.735 --> 38:33.695
why should I be the one who walks towards you?

38:34.309 --> 38:36.265
You would only stay where you are

38:37.245 --> 38:38.645
and wait for me to come to you.

38:38.936 --> 38:40.137
Even when you see me fall,

38:40.162 --> 38:41.562
you won't come over to help me up.

38:42.718 --> 38:43.798
Someone like you,

38:44.052 --> 38:45.052
why should I...

38:46.254 --> 38:47.975
Why should I walk towards you?

38:57.122 --> 38:58.122
Yes.

38:59.361 --> 39:00.401
I'm selfish.

39:01.169 --> 39:02.649
I'm very selfish.

39:03.974 --> 39:06.153
Even when it comes to the person I like, I'm selfish.

39:07.175 --> 39:09.495
I want to see you make an effort

39:10.881 --> 39:12.481
before I am willing to walk towards you.

39:13.642 --> 39:15.122
Otherwise, if I lose everything,

39:16.202 --> 39:18.055
and you are still standing in the same place,

39:18.642 --> 39:19.975
what am I supposed to do then?

39:27.682 --> 39:29.122
My intention isn't pure.

39:30.361 --> 39:31.961
I'm being calculative.

39:35.801 --> 39:38.001
I want you to make an effort too.

39:39.048 --> 39:40.528
I also want you

39:40.609 --> 39:43.250
to take a step towards me.

39:44.808 --> 39:47.234
But why won't you walk over?

39:47.315 --> 39:51.074
Song Yan, why won't you walk towards me?

39:54.321 --> 39:56.921
Why?

40:01.642 --> 40:05.602
I can't feel your affection at all.

40:11.361 --> 40:13.481
You definitely don't like me that much.

40:17.122 --> 40:19.721
You don't like me that much, do you?

40:19.915 --> 40:22.435
You don't like me that much, do you?

40:23.174 --> 40:25.413
You definitely don't like me that much.

40:25.881 --> 40:26.962
If you don't,

40:27.042 --> 40:29.202
why did you say that to me?

40:29.401 --> 40:30.921
Why did you say

40:31.014 --> 40:33.211
you liked me with your life?

40:33.292 --> 40:34.997
I believed you!

40:35.397 --> 40:38.397
I believed you, Song Yan!

40:38.822 --> 40:40.442
I believed you!

40:40.522 --> 40:42.122
-I believed you! -Let's go home!

40:44.441 --> 40:45.441
Get up.

40:55.684 --> 40:56.684
Let me tell you,

41:00.308 --> 41:01.947
I won't walk towards you anymore.

41:09.064 --> 41:10.064
I won't.

41:17.202 --> 41:18.562
It's not what you think!

41:20.401 --> 41:22.202
-It's not what you think! -Zhai Miao!

41:27.749 --> 41:28.749
Yan...

42:00.162 --> 42:01.162
Yan...

42:11.321 --> 42:12.961
Yan! Yan!
